   "seconds": 6,
   "script_line": "The tool has four registers, from research into the experience economy. Any moment you offer lives in four dimensions: aesthetic — the guest is somewhere beautiful and needs to do nothing; educational — they learn something new; escapist — they take part, they choose, they get their hands dirty; entertainment — they enjoy themselves, they laugh. Memorable experiences touch all four. Weak ones stay in one. And most badly designed activities get stuck in the educational: someone explaining things to people standing still.",
